"19|"
"20|# Blog Discourse: Real Discourse Research, API-Free"
"24|Adapted from the methodology of `last30days-skill` (Matt Van Horn, MIT, https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill). The upstream uses platform APIs; this sub-skill uses WebSearch with platform-targeted site operators. No API keys required."
