"86|- Hreflang tags must only appear on canonical URLs"
"88|- The canonical URL and hreflang URL must match exactly (including trailing slashes)"
"91|### 7. Protocol Consistency"
"92|- All URLs in an hreflang set must use the same protocol (HTTPS or HTTP)"
"96|### 8. Cross-Domain Support"
"102|## Common Mistakes"
"108|| Missing x-default when fallback behavior is required | Medium | Add x-default pointing to fallback/selector page |"
